                                                "sense_id": "d99152b7-646e-32ff-abf8-629031b36ffb",
                                                "text": "All about me the Red Weed clambered among the ruins, writhing to get above me in the dim. Night, the Mother of Fear and Mystery, was coming upon me."
                                            }
