                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b17b5906-bde6-4260-9a36-e6511797c8f2",
                                                "sense_id": "de12d59b-ecf5-3a3e-ac36-859ef45b0e6a",
                                                "text": "He dimmed the lights and put on soft music."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "06c5123b-bca2-3831-9c14-5599db4dc7ee",
                                        "entry_id": "0059b502-02cd-301c-96c9-50b7fb87b4dc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To become darker."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc9454f4-1a0a-44d7-9846-6c67929bced1",
                                                "sense_id": "06c5123b-bca2-3831-9c14-5599db4dc7ee",
                                                "text": "The lights dimmed briefly when the air conditioning was turned on."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "13fefeb3-8a17-3c5c-ad59-a1f893a30eb0",
                                        "entry_id": "0059b502-02cd-301c-96c9-50b7fb87b4dc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To render dim, obscure, or dark; to make less bright or distinct."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "102be706-a5bb-4ea6-9c80-18c164ad8c6b",
                                                "sense_id": "13fefeb3-8a17-3c5c-ad59-a1f893a30eb0",
                                                "text": "a king among his courtiers,[…] who out to dim the lustre of all his attendants"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6467722f-5765-47fd-a02c-5c5d3b8730e2",
                                                "sense_id": "13fefeb3-8a17-3c5c-ad59-a1f893a30eb0",
                                                "text": "Now ſet the ſun, and twilight dimm'd the ways, […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "12c52eb7-7ab4-326f-bcb0-e6b1f0d46401",
                                        "entry_id": "0059b502-02cd-301c-96c9-50b7fb87b4dc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To deprive of distinct vision; to hinder from seeing clearly, either by dazzling or clouding the eyes; to darken the senses or understanding of."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d45d83bd-2a25-4209-b627-1608dcaa326a",
                                                "sense_id": "12c52eb7-7ab4-326f-bcb0-e6b1f0d46401",
                                                "text": "And with our Sun-bright armour as we march,\nWeel chaſe the Starrs from heauen, and dim their eies\nThat ſtand and muſe at our admyred armes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "42bb43aa-fa49-4716-b75b-276dd33cf50d",
                                                "sense_id": "12c52eb7-7ab4-326f-bcb0-e6b1f0d46401",
                                                "text": "Her starry eyes were dimm'd with streaming tears."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "82c3fc95-2dc9-3741-8c99-4082a003e974",
                                        "entry_id": "0059b502-02cd-301c-96c9-50b7fb87b4dc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To diminish, dull, or curtail."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19ed4471-4e13-4d9a-b8f4-59ea8e705bd3",
                                                "sense_id": "82c3fc95-2dc9-3741-8c99-4082a003e974",
                                                "text": "All these setbacks had started to dim the hopes of the students."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7fa8f967-1045-4ef0-af3b-5d8b26edcd9f",
                                                "sense_id": "82c3fc95-2dc9-3741-8c99-4082a003e974",
                                                "text": "Nothing will dim their spirit of resilience."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3c5065d5-02b0-441b-89b4-a41a4a390990",
                                                "sense_id": "82c3fc95-2dc9-3741-8c99-4082a003e974",
                                                "text": "A glut might dim the outlook for grain futures."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "200f8c00-b46d-486a-ab16-a59e64e9f621",
                        "source_entry_id": "d92fe96a-66c8-383c-9ec3-0c05e872eb82",
                        "source_sense_id": "a7752ef9-cef3-30d8-92d8-15e04f5c4e5e",
